{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/944335-alien-character-sheet-questions","id":944335,"title":"Alien character sheet questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-05T08:28:21-07:00","id":944335,"title":"Alien character sheet questions","content":"i was looking at the version put up by Mr.Gone and was wondering what the section for Qualities was all about, i notice you also get a few dots for it to start out with at the bottom where it list the quick reference guide for character creation. Can anyone tell me what it is about?<br /> <br /> i also noticed they don't have a supernatural advantage section like Blood Potency/Gnosis/Primal Urge or any exclusive spendable resource like Vitae/Mana/Essence, is there another version that has these two sections included as blank so we can make up our own?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T09:52:01-07:00","id":944375,"title":"","content":"The entire sheet is based on the aliens 'template' from mirrors - infinite macabre, the space opera rules hack for 1st edition. Qualities are the things that make each race unique, like being really warmongery or having natural weapons. They don't have supernatural traits by default because the races aren't meant to be actual templates with supernatural powers (same reason humans don't have a powerstat or magical fuel section), they're just sentient alien species. Not to say they can't then gain a template though, just that they don't have the elements of one as a default.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6365,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","user":"Fumus","date":". 08-05-2016, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T14:41:47-07:00","id":944526,"title":"","content":"i thought being really warmongery or having natural weapons was gained through Merits, thanks for letting me know.<br /> <br /> i was going to buy infinite macabre but at drivethrurpg they only seem to have it as a PDF. i did buy a Hard cover copy of the regular Mirrors book though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12063-seta143","name":"Seta143","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T15:26:26-07:00","id":944557,"title":"","content":"You know, I wouldn't mind a CofD alien game... it's one of the few horror creature types that they haven't really touched yet. I would kill for that book. &quot;Alien: the Contact,&quot; or &quot;Alien: the Visitation,&quot; anyone?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":6498,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","user":"Haberdasher","date":". 08-0